<section class="wealth-builder-section bg-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-left">
        <h2 class="section-label font-secondary">Karma Capital Wealth Builder PMS</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-right">
        <p class="section-text font-secondary">
          An unconstrained, all cap strategy designed to deliver consistent capital appreciation across market cycles. The mandate retains the flexibility to pivot capital between Large, Mid, and Small Cap segments based on relative valuation and risk-reward dynamics.
        </p>
        
        <div class="structure-block">
          <h4 class="structure-title font-secondary">Structure:</h4>
          <ul class="structure-list font-secondary">
            <li><strong>Style:</strong> Long-Only Equity.</li>
            <li><strong>Portfolio:</strong> Concentrated high-conviction portfolio (typically 20-25 stocks).</li>
            <li><strong>Composition:</strong> A strategic blend of established market leaders and high-growth emerging companies built on Early Cycle thesis.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <a href="/kc-pms" class="view-strategy-link font-secondary">View Karma Wealth Builder Strategy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .wealth-builder-section {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background-color: #f8f9fa; /* slightly off-white to distinguish from the overview section */
    border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4rem;
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .col-left {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 300px;
  }

  .col-right {
    flex: 2;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .section-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .structure-block {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    
    .structure-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .structure-list {
      list-style-type: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      
      li {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #333;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        display: flex;
        
        &::before {
          content: "-";
          margin-right: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        strong {
          font-weight: 600;
          color: #1a1a1a;
          margin-right: 0.25rem;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  .view-strategy-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
    
    &:hover {
      color: #75b0e2; /* brand blue */
    }
  }
</style>
